<h2 id="use-cases">Best Use Cases</h2>
<h3>ChatGPT Excels At:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Content Writing:</strong> Blog posts, articles, marketing copy, social media content</li>
<li><strong>Coding Assistance:</strong> Debugging, code explanation, writing functions, learning programming</li>
<li><strong>Research &amp; Analysis:</strong> Summarizing documents, answering questions, data analysis</li>
<li><strong>Creative Tasks:</strong> Brainstorming, storytelling, image generation with DALL-E</li>
<li><strong>Learning &amp; Education:</strong> Explaining concepts, tutoring, language learning</li>
<li><strong>Business Tasks:</strong> Email drafting, meeting summaries, presentations</li>
<li><strong>Data Work:</strong> Excel formulas, data visualization, statistical analysis</li>
</ul>
<h3>May Not Be Ideal For:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Tasks requiring real-time information without web browsing enabled</li>
<li>Highly specialized domain expertise (consider domain-specific AI)</li>
<li>Critical applications requiring 100% accuracy (always verify important facts)</li>
<li>Processing extremely long documents (consider Claude for 200K context)</li>
</ul>
